	(text_box "These three gates are U1 itself -- the same XC7A35T-CPG236 whose I/O are on sheet 6. \nVCCO pins are named for the bank they feed (bank 14 has nine supply balls, bank 0 only two). \nBANK216 holds the unused transceiver supplies; UG482 requires MGTAVCC/MGTAVTT/MGTRREF \ntied to GND when the GTPs are unused. \nVCCADC/GNDADC/VREFP/VREFN stay on sheet 6: they sit behind ferrites L6/L7 with C123/C124 \nas the XADC supply filter, not on these rails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.914 219.202 0)
