		(property "NOTE" "Second half of a bulk position: each 47uF 1206 became two 22uF 0805. Nominal drops 47 -> 44 uF per position, but the 0805 is 10V where the 1206 was 6.3V, so it derates less under bias and the pair should deliver at least what the single part did. Height also drops 1.60 -> 1.45 mm max, which the back-side budget against the 2.54 mm header standoff cares about."
			(at 0 313.182 90)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
